2026-02-24 04:09:26.334 | 126682 (126682) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": "{\"plan\": \"# Dialysis Center Frontend Implementation Plan\\n\\n## Overview\\nImplement comprehensive Vue 3 frontend architecture based on `DIALYSIS_CENTER_FRONTEND_DESIGN.md` (3400+ lines specification).\\n\\n## Current State\\n- \u2705 Basic DocType form scripts exist (patient.js, dialysis_session.js, etc.)\\n- \u2705 Basic CSS styling in dialysis_center.css\\n- \u2705 Comprehensive API endpoints whitelisted in hooks.py\\n- \u274c No Vue 3 components implemented\\n- \u274c No reusable component library\\n- \u274c No dashboards or analytics charts\\n- \u274c No utility modules (validators, formatters, API helpers)\\n- \u274c No build configuration for Vue/esbuild\\n\\n## Implementation Plan\\n\\n### Phase 1: Build Infrastructure Setup\\n**Files to create:**\\n- `dialysis_center/public/src/` directory structure\\n- `dialysis_center/build.config.js` - esbuild configuration for Vue 3\\n- Update `package.json` with Vue 3 dependencies\\n- Create `.bundle.js` entry points for component registration\\n\\n### Phase 2: Core Utilities & Helpers\\n**Create utility modules:**\\n- `public/src/utils/validators.js` - Form validation utilities\\n- `public/src/utils/formatters.js` - Date, currency, number formatting\\n- `public/src/utils/api-helpers.js` - Organized API call wrappers (by module)\\n- `public/src/utils/constants.js` - Status options, blood types, etc.\\n\\n### Phase 3: Reusable Vue 3 Components\\n**Create component library:**\\n- `public/src/components/PatientCard.vue` - Patient info display card\\n- `public/src/components/SessionCard.vue` - Session status & vitals card\\n- `public/src/components/AppointmentCalendar.vue` - Weekly appointment calendar\\n- `public/src/components/VitalsChart.vue` - Real-time vitals line chart\\n- `public/src/components/StatCard.vue` - Dashboard metric card\\n- `public/src/components/AlertBanner.vue` - Clinical alerts display\\n\\n### Phase 4: Dashboard Pages\\n**Create custom pages:**\\n- `public/src/pages/SessionDashboard.js` - Real-time session monitoring\\n- `public/src/pages/AnalyticsDashboard.js` - Charts & KPIs\\n- `public/src/components/RevenueChart.vue` - Revenue analytics\\n- `public/src/components/SessionsChart.vue` - Session trends\\n\\n### Phase 5: Enhanced Form Scripts\\n**Enhance existing form scripts with Vue integration:**\\n- Update `patient.js` - Add PatientCard component integration\\n- Update `dialysis_session_enhanced.js` - Add VitalsChart & SessionCard\\n- Update `appointment.js` - Add AppointmentCalendar component\\n- Add real-time updates via Socket.IO listeners\\n\\n### Phase 6: Styling & Responsiveness\\n**Create comprehensive SCSS:**\\n- `public/src/styles/components.scss` - Component-specific styles\\n- `public/src/styles/dashboard.scss` - Dashboard layouts\\n- `public/src/styles/charts.scss` - Chart styling\\n- Update `responsive_design.scss` - Mobile-first responsive rules\\n\\n### Phase 7: State Management & Real-time\\n**Implement client-side state:**\\n- `public/src/store/session-store.js` - Active sessions state\\n- `public/src/realtime/session-updates.js` - Socket.IO handlers\\n- Real-time vital signs updates\\n- Session status notifications\\n\\n### Phase 8: Integration & Testing\\n- Register all bundles in `hooks.py`\\n- Run `bench build` to compile assets\\n- Test component rendering in forms\\n- Test dashboard pages\\n- Test real-time updates\\n- Mobile responsiveness testing\\n\\n## File Structure\\n```\\ndialysis_center/public/\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 src/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 components/      # Vue 3 components\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 pages/           # Custom page JS\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 utils/           # Utility modules\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 store/           # State management\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 realtime/        # Socket.IO handlers\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 styles/          # SCSS modules\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 js/                  # Compiled bundles (output)\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 css/                 # Compiled CSS (output)\\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 dist/                # Production bundles\\n```\\n\\n## Key Technologies\\n- **Vue 3 Composition API** - All components\\n- **Chart.js** - Analytics charts\\n- **Socket.IO** - Real-time updates via frappe.realtime\\n- **esbuild** - Fast bundling\\n- **SCSS** - Advanced styling with mixins\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- \u2705 All Vue components render correctly\\n- \u2705 Dashboards display real-time data\\n- \u2705 Forms enhanced with interactive components\\n- \u2705 Charts show correct analytics\\n- \u2705 Mobile-responsive design (320px+)\\n- \u2705 Real-time updates working\\n- \u2705 Build process successful (`bench build`)\\n\\n## Estimated Effort\\n~300-400 lines of code per component/utility \u00d7 20+ files = ~6000-8000 lines total implementation\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01QAqqqMaDDJYWD5rEBhbfxs", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
