2026-02-24 04:24:43.662 | 126682 (126682) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "bash", "args": "{\"command\": \"cat > frappe-bench/apps/dialysis_center/QUICK_BUILD_GUIDE.md << 'EOF'\\n# Dialysis Center - Quick Build Guide\\n\\n## \ud83d\ude80 5-Minute Setup\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n- Frappe bench installed\\n- Node.js 18+ installed\\n- npm available\\n\\n### Step 1: Install Dependencies (1 minute)\\n```bash\\ncd frappe-bench/apps/dialysis_center\\nnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Step 2: Build Frontend Assets (2 minutes)\\n```bash\\n# Option A: Using npm (recommended for development)\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# Option B: Using bench (for production)\\ncd ~/frappe-bench\\nbench build --app dialysis_center\\n```\\n\\n### Step 3: Verify Build (30 seconds)\\n```bash\\n# Check compiled bundles exist\\nls -la dialysis_center/public/dist/js/\\n\\n# Should show:\\n# components.bundle.js\\n# dashboard.bundle.js\\n# utils.bundle.js\\n# realtime.bundle.js\\n```\\n\\n### Step 4: Test in Browser (1 minute)\\n1. Open Frappe desk: `http://localhost:8000`\\n2. Open browser console (F12)\\n3. Look for confirmation messages:\\n   - \u2705 Dialysis Center utilities loaded\\n   - \u2705 Dialysis Center Vue components loaded\\n   - \u2705 Dialysis Center dashboards loaded\\n   - \u2705 Dialysis Center real-time system loaded\\n\\n### Step 5: Test a Form (30 seconds)\\n1. Go to Patient List\\n2. Open any Patient record\\n3. Check for patient statistics dashboard below patient name\\n4. Open browser console - should see no errors\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd04 Development Workflow\\n\\n### Watch Mode (Auto-rebuild on changes)\\n```bash\\ncd frappe-bench/apps/dialysis_center\\nnpm run watch\\n```\\n\\n### Hot Reload (If enabled)\\n```bash\\ncd ~/frappe-bench\\nbench watch\\n```\\n\\n### Clear Cache After Changes\\n```bash\\nbench clear-cache\\nbench build --app dialysis_center\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \u2705 Quick Test Checklist\\n\\n- [ ] Bundles compiled successfully\\n- [ ] No console errors in browser\\n- [ ] Patient form shows statistics\\n- [ ] Appointment form shows available slots\\n- [ ] Session form has vitals chart\\n- [ ] Real-time updates working\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udc1b Common Issues\\n\\n### Issue: `npm install` fails\\n**Solution**: Update Node.js to version 18+\\n```bash\\nnode --version  # Should be 18.0.0 or higher\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: Build errors about Vue\\n**Solution**: Clear node_modules and reinstall\\n```bash\\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\\nnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: Bundles not loading in browser\\n**Solution**: Clear Frappe cache\\n```bash\\nbench clear-cache\\nbench restart\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: \\\"Module not found\\\" errors\\n**Solution**: Check import paths are correct (relative paths with .js extension)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udce6 What Gets Built\\n\\n1. **utils.bundle.js** - Formatters, validators, API helpers, constants\\n2. **components.bundle.js** - Vue 3 components (PatientCard, SessionCard, etc.)\\n3. **dashboard.bundle.js** - SessionDashboard, AnalyticsDashboard\\n4. **realtime.bundle.js** - State store, Socket.IO handlers, notifications\\n\\nAll bundles are automatically included in every Frappe page via `hooks.py`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfaf Next Steps After Build\\n\\n1. **Create custom pages** using dashboard classes\\n2. **Mount Vue components** in forms\\n3. **Use utility functions** for validation\\n4. **Test real-time updates** with multiple users\\n\\nDone! Your Dialysis Center frontend is ready to use! \ud83c\udf89\\nEOF\\necho \\\"\u2705 Quick build guide created\\\"\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01FGrxnR38VkNw3g5NyNQHTR", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
